01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1d68pjnqQ7YQ7kNvwHk63PE&_nc_oc=Adr-k39lFmst5kiITAfZyxVncfbIPtuqaPi8hD4uGGclv4GhXzCVIA13hBrKWzPzx4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFu4JOY1JdoKDtJe6mo9xYNWSDF1EWiKMRjSxgAKOu1TQ&oe=6A77163D"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KXp2JuCp0_sQ7kNvwFekSrG&_nc_oc=AdqHD5kFHyZY74cxrO_AT0oNoSIR0FcfLjuiA5bnJDgoA8CX1B6W-z3ofj5wUpTk-Zg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHsvaFzAVjW59YXBVrh6M6BfyNCacwdAxvUaeLYhKg7qg&oe=6A7734BB"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NBnhA3ICRC8Q7kNvwFzMByb&_nc_oc=AdqA8wZ3qduzyE3GVumgmp5NzITDA58pn240bXRebgxtm9mVh6nXSIpcOI913NYQJoE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF3rPyVn5CT_LPf4DnBkGOzAPPVwpcCur80I6Vzes4EjQ&oe=6A7711A5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a